Test D1: a batch entry from a statement wrapper without readOutcome throws
when meta.changes is read, instead of reporting 0. startConnection loses its
unreachable no_budget branch (run() only polls while budget remains and
nothing before the first Gmail call spends it). Adds a pin that the failing
notice claim works on a cursor with a null fingerprint.
